  "prefLabel": "Rev 904.04 Exemption For Trust Income Designated For Contribution to Charities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 904.04 Exemption For Trust Income Designated For Contribution to Charities. The portion of a trust's income required to be donated by the trust document to a charity which is exempt from taxation pursuant to RSA 77:8, shall be exempt from taxation to the donor trust, provided that the funds donated are actually used in the charitable function of the donee.\n\nSource. #4557, eff 12-28-88; ss by #5947, eff 12-29-94; ss by #6321, eff 8-22-96; ss by #8137, eff 8-10-04; ss by #10211, eff 10-24-12; ss by #13443, eff 8-12-22",
